  "commit_message": "Cut the macOS quiet stage down to the tests with wall-clock deadlines\n\nThe previous stage moved 47 files chosen by child-process CPU, which\nmade the macOS jobs about twice as long (16 to 21 min). Starvation can\nonly break a test that has a wall-clock deadline, so the quiet stage is\nnow just those: the 24 multiprocessing spawners with proc.join\nbackstops, the three files with hard '< N s' asserts (redos chokepoint,\nquadratic_dos, pathsec sweep tag) and both CoreNLP files, including\ntest_corenlp.p",
